# Cloak and Dagger: Jakoh's Events (280, 283) alternate with his script (UseFallback); 284 (Progress) does not. A level
# 75 Thief, dagger skill 2300, the Dagger of Trials held, Cloak and Dagger accepted and TuningOut_Progress 2 (GMs: his
# script starts 294). 280, then his script's 294. The map (a GM): 283, then 294, then 283 again (UseFallback set). The
# annals (a GM): 284 (a progress event plays over his script's turn); finished: completed.
lists Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger
char zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=THF lvl=75
skill Dagger 2300
item DaggerOfTrials
quest Outlands.CloakAndDagger accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
charvar TuningOut_Progress 2
login
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # no map: 280 (the dagger held: 2)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth           # a GM
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # the map: 283
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # his script's turn: 294
finish
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # 283
finish
keyitem AnnalsOfTruth                   # a GM
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # the annals: 284 (Progress) over his script's turn
finish                                  # completed; the key items taken; Evisceration
